azing practices, manure management, transhumance type, and period). Farm outputs such as lambs sold, culled sheep, or wool produced were registered from the information gathered in the survey, together with average price received by farmers from the different co-products.", "management": [{"term": {"@type": "Term", "termType": "landCover", "name": "Native pasture", "units": "% area", "@id": "nativePasture"}, "value": 100, "endDate": "2009", "@type": "Management"}, {"@type": "Management", "term": {"@type": "Term", "@id": "permanentPasture", "name": "Permanent pasture", "termType": "landCover", "units": "% area"}, "value": 100, "endDate": "2009-12-31", "added": ["term", "value", "endDate"], "addedVersion": ["0.70.0", "0.70.0", "0.70.0"]}, {"@type": "Management", "term": {"@type": "Term", "@id": "pastureGrass", "name": "Pasture grass", "termType": "landUseManagement", "units": "% area"}, "value": 100, "endDate": "2009-12-31", "startDate": "2008-12-31", "added": ["term", "value", "endDate", "startDate"], "addedVersion": ["0.70.0", "0.70.0", "0.70.0", "0.70.0"]}, {"@type": "Management", "term": {"@type": "Term", "@id": "hillyPastureSystem", "name": "Hilly pasture system", "termType": "system", "units": "%"}, "value": 75.06849315068493, "endDate": "2009-12-31", "startDate": "2008-12-31", "added": ["term", "value", "endDate", "startDate"], "addedVersion": ["0.70.0", "0.70.0", "0.70.0", "0.70.0"]}, {"@type": "Management", "term": {"@type": "Term", "@id": "indoorAnimalSystem", "name": "Indoor animal system", "termType": "system", "units": "%"}, "value": 24.93150684931507, "endDate": "2009-12-31", "startDate": "2008-12-31", "added": ["term", "value", "endDate", "startDate"], "addedVersion": ["0.70.0", "0.70.0", "0.70.0", "0.70.0"]}, {"@type": "Management", "term": {"@type": "Term", "@id": "forest", "name": "Forest", "termType": "landCover", "units": "% area"}, "model": {"@type": "Term", "@id": "hestia", "name": "HESTIA", "termType": "model"}, "value": 0, "startDate": "1989-01